1
00:00:00,799 --> 00:00:04,149
(Sheldon:)And that ring was inscribed
with the phrase,

2
00:00:04,302 --> 00:00:06,412
"This, too, shall pass."

3
00:00:08,240 --> 00:00:10,580
-Hey, Cooper!
-Oh, my God.

4
00:00:10,742 --> 00:00:14,242
I heard you drunk-dialed
Stephen Hawking last night?

5
00:00:14,412 --> 00:00:16,082
Classic!

6
00:00:16,248 --> 00:00:17,348
(Howard:)Get out of here, Barry.

7
00:00:17,515 --> 00:00:19,355
(Barry:)Whatever you say...

8
00:00:19,517 --> 00:00:21,857
(Emily:)...Clogzilla.

9
00:00:25,357 --> 00:00:27,137
(Sheldon:)Clogzilla. That's pretty funny.

10
00:00:29,261 --> 00:00:31,541
(Sheldon:)I don't think that's gonna pass.

11
00:00:36,101 --> 00:00:37,941
(Answerphone:)Next message.

12
00:00:38,103 --> 00:00:39,813
It's me again!

13
00:00:39,971 --> 00:00:42,111
(Sheldon(voice):)I gave up string theory.

14
00:00:42,273 --> 00:00:44,013
(Sheldon(voice):)You should give up black holes,

15
00:00:44,175 --> 00:00:48,385
(Sheldon(voice):)and we can totally
solve crimes together!

16
00:00:48,513 --> 00:00:50,183
(Answerphone:)Next message.

17
00:00:50,348 --> 00:00:51,828
Do you know what's great?!

18
00:00:51,983 --> 00:00:53,963
(Sheldon:)Geology.

19
00:00:54,052 --> 00:00:55,192
Woo!

20
00:00:56,221 --> 00:00:58,061
Look at this geode!

21
00:00:58,223 --> 00:01:00,363
That's fun to say!

22
00:01:00,525 --> 00:01:04,805
Gee... ode! Gee... ode!

23
00:01:04,963 --> 00:01:06,463
(Answerphone:)Next message.

24
00:01:06,631 --> 00:01:08,631
Gee... ode!

25
00:01:09,334 --> 00:01:11,574
Gee... ode!

26
00:01:11,736 --> 00:01:13,976
(Sheldon(voice):)I kiss girls now.

27
00:01:16,341 --> 00:01:17,411
(Answerphone:)Next message.

28
00:01:17,575 --> 00:01:20,555
Hey, guess who I am!
Beep, bop, boop, bop!

29
00:01:20,645 --> 00:01:22,925
I'm you! Get it?!

30
00:01:24,249 --> 00:01:26,029
(Answerphone:)Next message.

31
00:01:26,184 --> 00:01:29,164
(Sheldon(voice):)Are you mad at me?

32
00:01:29,254 --> 00:01:32,164
(Sheldon(voice):)Oh, no, you're mad at me.

33
00:01:32,324 --> 00:01:34,364
I'm so sorry!

34
00:01:34,926 --> 00:01:36,166
Beep, bop, boop, bop!

35
00:01:37,595 --> 00:01:39,095
(Answerphone:)Next message.

36
00:01:39,264 --> 00:01:44,114
(Sheldon(voice):)Thiospinel sulfide.
Thiospinel sulfide.

37
00:01:44,269 --> 00:01:47,619
(Sheldon(voice):)That's even more fun
than gee... ode.

38
00:01:48,673 --> 00:01:50,883
(Sheldon(voice):)Hey, did you see
The LEGO Movie?

39
00:01:54,446 --> 00:01:56,926
(Stephen Hawking:)What a jackass.

